Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Provide awareness of QNX for tests

Provide an easy way for tests to tell if they are running on QNX or not.
This will make it easier to disable/skip some tests that need
functionality not on QNX.

In the case that caused this work to be done, test_mem_policy wanted to
disable warnings if running on QNX.
